# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# Prettier's endOfLine defaults to "lf", so without this a clone on a default
# Windows Git setup (core.autocrlf=true) checks every text file out as CRLF and
# `npm run lint` immediately fails on all of them - which also fails the build,
# since build runs lint first.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets git must never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
